  "body": "Elevated Elegance, Unforgettable Moments & Coastal Lifestyle \r\n\r\nLocated in a sought-after, elevated position in Torbay, this beautifully presented freehold home seamlessly blends everyday comfort with tranquil surroundings—and carries a truly special story. Having been thoughtfully upgraded with a brand-new, modern kitchen by the young owners, this private haven even served as the romantic venue for their very own wedding. Whether you are looking for a warm family sanctuary or a flexible work-from-home setup, this property offers the ultimate coastal lifestyle starter.\r\n\r\nKey Features & Benefits:\r\n\r\n• Newly Renovated Modern Kitchen: Carefully upgraded by the young vendors, featuring quality European appliances, crisp finishes, and brilliant natural light that connects effortlessly to the open-plan living and dining spaces.  \r\n\r\n• Picturesque Outdoor Living: The double decks offer exceptional versatility—enjoy a relaxing soak in the spa with friends on one deck while taking in the elevated, leafy Torbay views from the other. The private setting and spacious layout even provided the perfect backdrop for the owners' memorable wedding day.\r\n\r\n• Freehold Title & Elevated Position: Set on a 553m² (more or less) freehold section, position high to capture maximum sunshine and lovely birdsong in a private setting.\r\n\r\n• Comfortable Layout with Master Suite: Approx. 163m² floor area featuring 3 double bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, including a master bedroom complete with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\n• Child & Pet Friendly: The upper-level outdoor entertaining areas are fully fenced, providing peace of mind for young kids and pets.\r\n\r\n• Versatile Two-Level Living: The clever split-level configuration allows the lower bedroom to easily double as a dedicated home office or work-from-home space.\r\n\r\n• Ample Parking & Storage: Internal access single remote garage, plus off-street parking and a dedicated car pad for guests or multi-car families.\r\n\r\n• Top School Zoning: Zoned for excellent local schools, including Glamorgan Primary, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\n• Unbeatable Coastal Convenience: Minutes to both Torbay and Long Bay villages, Emlyn Reserve, Long Bay Regional Park, and several stunning local beaches.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are highly motivated and determined to secure a sale before Christmas! Opportunities like this don't last long—call today to arrange your private viewing.",
